ttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScj33BhDg2c7F9OBcHTeUPsHA2-91jXNKivaJ6zDqIEzEmu2g/viewform?usp=dialog&amp;usp=embed_facebook"><meta property="og:image" content="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/hDDMOiAS6FA9b0We4E6R9aZhWHlrl07fo9IuADb6P2iE4bZ65iRnobXeixO4eRlP3upQLs5qTMqQ5Rw=w1200-h630-p"><meta property="og:image:width" content="200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="200"><meta property="og:description" content="Sungshin Women&#39;s University
Exchange Student Program Nomination Form
Instructions:
This form must be completed by the Partner University’s Outbound Program Coordinator and submitted in English.
The form will remain open until Oct 23, 2026, and nominations will be considered only for Spring 2027.
No replies will be provided once the form is submitted.
For multiple nominations, please complete a separate form for each student.
If a nominee withdraws from the exchange program, please inform us immediately.
Key Dates:
Nomination Period: Sep 14 – Oct 23, 2026 2026년 9월 14일 ~ 10월 23일
Online Application: Oct 26 – Nov 23, 2026 (Link: tis.sungshin.ac.kr/comm/nxui/member/join.do?join=9)
Original Document Submission (by postal mail): Nov 23, 2026
CoA Issuance Period: End of Dec 2026 (for Spring 2027)
Contact: intl-stud@sunghsin.ac.kr
