LgNcQe" dir="auto" role="heading" aria-level="1">Spring 2027 Exchange Student Nomination Form<span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="cBGGJ OIC90c" dir="auto"><div><b>Sungshin Women's University</b></div><div><b>Exchange Student Program Nomination Form</b></div><div><p><strong>Instructions:</strong></p><ol><li>This form must be completed by the Partner University’s Outbound Program Coordinator and submitted in English.</li><li><span>The form will remain open until Oct 23, 2026, and nominations will be considered only for Spring 2027.</span></li><li><span>No replies will be provided once the form is submitted.</span></li><li><span>For multiple nominations, please complete a separate form for each student.</span></li><li><span>If a nominee withdraws from the exchange program, please inform us immediately.</span></li></ol><p><strong>Key Dates:</strong></p><ul><li><span><b>Nomination Period: Sep 14 – Oct 23, 2026 </b></span>2026<span>년 </span><span>9</span><span>월 </span><span>14</span><span>일 </span><span>~ 10</span><span>월 </span><span>23</span><span>일</span><div></div></li><li><b>Online Application: Oct 26 – Nov 23, 2026</b>  (Link: <a href="https://tis.sungshin.ac.kr/comm/nxui/member/join.do?join=9">tis.sungshin.ac.kr/comm/nxui/member/join.do?join=9</a>)</li><li><b>Original Document Submission</b> <b>(by postal mail): Nov 23, 2026</b></li><li>CoA Issuance Period: End of Dec 2026 (for Spring 2027)<br></li></ul><p><strong>Contact:</strong> <a>intl-stud@sunghsin.ac.kr</a><br><strong>Fact Sheet:</strong> <a href="https://www.sungshin.ac.kr/int/13456/subview.do?enc=Zm5jdDF8QEB8JTJGYmJzJTJGaW50JTJGMzgyOCUyRjE1MjY1OSUyRmFydGNsVmlldy5kbyUzRg%3D%3D">Exchange Students - Fall 2026 - Call for Exchange Student Nomination<br></a></p></div></div><div jsname="F0H8Yc" class="liS6Hc"></div></div><div class="zAVwcb"></div><div class="DqBBlb"><div class="Oh1Vtf"><div class="kesdnc" id="SMMuxb"><a jscontroller="A2m8uc" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md; click:mAWTmb;" href="https://accou